    <!--
      Includes only. Every changeset is formatted SQL in its own NNNN-<slug>.sql file beside this
      one - see the database-migration capability. This file stays XML because Liquibase's
      formatted-SQL parser has no include directive; it is wiring, not a migration.

      Schema for export-spring-boot-starter. Changeset ids and author are namespaced
      ("export-NNNN", "ludwig-export") so they never collide with a consuming application's own
      changesets in the shared DATABASECHANGELOG table - see ExportLiquibaseAutoConfiguration,
      which registers this changelog as a second, independent SpringLiquibase bean. Postgres-only:
      JSONB columns and partial indexes throughout.
    -->
